	(text "AUX header: 1 +5V, 2 +3V3, 3 GPIO11, 4 GPIO13, 5 GND. Both pins are touch (T11, T13) and ADC2 inputs; ADC2 is not usable while WiFi is on."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
