	(text "Qwiic / STEMMA QT J41 (JST SH): 1 GND, 2 +3V3, 3 SDA = GPIO11, 4 SCL = GPIO13, on the same lines as J40. For I2C fit the two 4.7k pull-ups unless the module has its own."
